  defeatText: The Silver Hand seem to all be cleared out now...
  nameText: Silver Hand Mage
  blurbText: This mage was actually a student of The Caller at Fellglow Keep. You
    know, that rival school that Sayori and Yuri were <i>supposed</i> to deal with.
